# -- Build output -----------------------------------------------------------
/emission
/dist/

# NOTE: internal/web/dist is intentionally tracked. Committing the built UI
# lets `go install github.com/jdel/emission/cmd/emission@latest` produce a
# binary with the embedded SPA. Rebuild via `make ui` and commit the result
# whenever the UI source changes.

# Generated swagger docs (regenerated by `make swagger`)
/pkg/docs/

